What are Fully Automatic Vending Machines?
Fully automatic vending machines are self-contained retail units that dispense products or services without human intervention. These advanced systems incorporate IoT connectivity, cashless payment options, and AI-driven inventory management to provide 24/7 service across various locations including shopping centers, transit hubs, and corporate campuses. Modern iterations can handle everything from snacks and beverages to electronics and pharmaceuticals, with some units even featuring facial recognition and personalized recommendations.

